        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Peter Facinelli, Deborah Kaplan, Harry Elfont, Michael Corrente\n- Films: Twilight, Can't Hardly Wait, Loosies, Love Is Not a Crime, Pick Pocket\n- Roles: Dr. Carlisle Cullen, Mike Dexter\n\nFacts:\n- In 1998, \"Can't Hardly Wait\" was released as an American teen comedy film written and directed by Deborah Kaplan and Harry Elfont.\n- In 1998, Peter Facinelli played Mike Dexter in the film \"Can't Hardly Wait.\"\n- Peter Facinelli played Dr. Carlisle Cullen in the film adaptations of the \"Twilight\" novel series.\n- In 2012, \"Loosies\" was released as a romantic comedy-drama film also known as \"Love Is Not a Crime\" and \"Pick Pocket.\"\n- In 2012, Peter Facinelli wrote and produced \"Loosies.\"\n- In 2012, Michael Corrente directed \"Loosies.\"",
